{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker built with samplers runs them on its worker, after its enrichers, so a sampler sees"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what they set:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker(samplers: [","    .events(of: Scrolled.self, rate: 0.1),","    .events(where: { $0.consentCategory == .performance }, rate: 0.5),","])"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each sampler decides on its own, and a record is kept only if every sampler that applies to it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps it. A kept record carries the product of their rates as its "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey"},{"type":"text","text":"; one no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler applies to is always kept and carries no key. Each dropped record is reported on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The decisions come from the tracker’s sampling seed, the same on every platform and Swift"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"release: with a seed fixed, which events are kept is fixed too. Each sampler draws from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream of its own, picked by its place in the tracker’s list: appending a sampler changes no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other’s decisions, but inserting, removing or reordering one gives every sampler after it a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream, so it decides differently under the same seed."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"anchor":"Type-Methods","title":"Type Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(of:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(where:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/grouped(by:where:rate:)"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Sampler.swift#L28","fileName":"Sampler.swift"},"externalID":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","title":"Sampler"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"Sampler","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/SampleRateKey":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","title":"SampleRateKey","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"text":" key of the rate a record was kept at, which a tracker’s ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler"},{"text":"s set on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the context of every record they keep.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SampleRateKey","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SampleRateKey","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampleratekey","role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/samplingDropReports":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SamplingDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/docume